{
  "bodyHash": "7564472be9fa55e8",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Create：Storage</h1>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 模組</a> 設計的全面性儲物擴充套件——內含分級儲物箱、可升級背包、連結式儲物網路，以及智慧型物品傳輸方塊。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/create_storage_2.png\" alt=\"create_storage_2.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-storage-neo-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/create-storage-neo-forge?logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&color=00af5c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-storage-neo-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1281770?logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&color=f16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Create-6.0.7 -4b8bc2\" alt=\"Create\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-21.1.181 -d88231\" alt=\"NeoForged\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-47.3.30 -26303d\" alt=\"Forge\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>什麼是 Create：Storage？</h2>\n<p><strong>Create：Storage</strong> 為 Create 的自動化生態系統擴充了專屬的儲物解決方案，其外觀與操作體驗完全融入原模組。無論您是在生產線上需要緊湊的過濾容器、大容量批量儲物、集中化管理的物品網路，還是適合探險的全能背包——本模組都能滿足您的需求。</p>\n<p>本模組最初由 <strong>FoxyNoTail</strong> 為 Fabric 平台開發，此為持續維護的 <strong>NeoForge/Forge</strong> 移植版本，功能已超越原版並持續擴展。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>儲物箱</h1>\n<h3>說明</h3>\n<p><strong>儲物箱</strong>與<strong>基礎儲物箱</strong>是專為緊湊型、可過濾的物品儲存所設計的容器。每種<strong>儲物箱</strong>變體提供不同的儲存容量與視覺風格，而<strong>基礎儲物箱</strong>則支援單一物品的大量儲存，並可透過升級提升容量。它們旨在無縫整合至 Create 模組的機械與物流系統中，提供簡潔且實用的方式來管理大量物品。</p>\n<h2>儲物箱</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>提供紙板、工業鐵／風化鐵、安山岩、銅、黃銅與硬化等變體</li>\n<li>每個儲物箱都具備 Create 過濾槽，可用於篩選可存入或取出的物品</li>\n<li>箱體正面設有顯示面板，可顯示物品數量與儲存飽和度</li>\n<li>配備指示燈，顯示儲物箱是否已滿、已空或已啟用清空模式</li>\n<li>玩家可直接與<strong>儲物箱</strong>互動以放入物品，無需開啟介面</li>\n<li>蹲下並手持空手點擊即可開啟介面</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_cardboard.png\" alt=\"storage_box_cardboard.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_industrial_iron.png\" alt=\"storage_box_industrial_iron.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_weathered_iron.png\" alt=\"storage_box_weathered_iron.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_andesite.png\" alt=\"storage_box_andesite.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_copper.png\" alt=\"storage_box_copper.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_brass.png\" alt=\"storage_box_brass.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_hardened.png\" alt=\"storage_box_hardened.png\"></p>\n<h2>基礎儲物箱</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>通用木質變體（所有變體屬性相同）</li>\n<li>預設最多儲存 2048 個物品（僅限單一物品類型）</li>\n<li>蹲下並手持空手點擊即可開啟介面</li>\n<li><strong>物品過濾器</strong>：<ul>\n<li>放入物品時自動設定</li>\n<li>使用<strong>扳手</strong>點擊即可移除過濾器（僅在儲物箱為空時有效）</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>升級模組</strong>：<ul>\n<li><em>清空升級：</em>自動處理（銷毀）溢出的物品</li>\n<li>使用方法：手持升級模組點擊正面顯示面板，或透過介面新增/移除</li>\n<li><em>容量升級：</em>使當前容量翻倍，最高可疊加 9 次</li>\n<li>使用方法：透過介面新增/移除</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_acacia.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_acacia.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_bamboo.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_bamboo.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_birch.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_birch.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_cherry.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_cherry.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_crimson.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_crimson.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_dark_oak.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_dark_oak.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_jungle.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_jungle.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_mangrove.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_mangrove.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_oak.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_oak.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_pale_oak.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_pale_oak.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_spruce.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_spruce.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_warped.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_warped.png\"></p>\n<p><em>注意：最大基礎容量為該物品最大堆疊數量的 32 倍。</em><br>\n<em>範例：橡木原木 = 2048、終界珍珠 = 512、水桶 = 32</em></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>基礎儲物網路</h1>\n<h3>說明</h3>\n<p>將多個<strong>基礎儲物箱</strong>連結成單一網路，讓玩家與自動化系統能從中央（或多個）節點存取與管理所有儲存的物品。基礎儲物網路透過<strong>儲物裝飾條</strong>（作為導管）將<strong>基礎儲物箱</strong>連接至<strong>儲物控制器</strong>而成。連接完成後，<strong>儲物控制器</strong>會匯整所有相連儲物箱的物品，並透過單一介面進行存取與取出。</p>\n<p>其他組件（如<strong>儲物介面</strong>）可用於透過自動化設備（漏斗、滑槽、導管等）與網路進行互動。</p>\n<h2>儲物裝飾條</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>將<strong>基礎儲物箱</strong>與<strong>儲物控制器</strong>及<strong>儲物介面</strong>方塊相連接</li>\n<li>連接時的外觀紋理會與基礎儲物箱的變體相匹配</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_acacia.png\" alt=\"casing_acacia.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_bamboo.png\" alt=\"casing_bamboo.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_birch.png\" alt=\"casing_birch.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_cherry.png\" alt=\"casing_cherry.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_crimson.png\" alt=\"casing_crimson.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_dark_oak.png\" alt=\"casing_dark_oak.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_jungle.png\" alt=\"casing_jungle.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_mangrove.png\" alt=\"casing_mangrove.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_oak.png\" alt=\"casing_oak.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_pale_oak.png\" alt=\"casing_pale_oak.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_spruce.png\" alt=\"casing_spruce.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_warped.png\" alt=\"casing_warped.png\"></p>\n<h2>儲物控制器</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>作為儲物網路的中央輸入/輸出樞紐</li>\n<li>使用<strong>儲物裝飾條</strong>連接至<strong>基礎儲物箱</strong></li>\n<li>連結至少一個<strong>基礎儲物箱</strong>後，指示燈會亮起</li>\n<li>支援手動互動與自動化設備（如漏斗、滑槽、導管等）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/storage_controller.png\" alt=\"storage_controller.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/storage_controller_connected.png\" alt=\"storage_controller_connected.png\"></p>\n<h2>儲物介面</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>類似<strong>儲物控制器</strong>，但有以下差異：<ul>\n<li>無法供玩家直接用於存入或取出物品</li>\n<li>無法獨立啟動或構成儲物網路（需搭配<strong>儲物控制器</strong>）</li>\n<li>專為自動化輸入/輸出設計（如漏斗、滑槽、導管等）</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/storage_interface.png\" alt=\"storage_interface.png\"></p>\n<h3>儲物介面（過濾型）</h3>\n<p>與儲物介面類似，但內建 Create 過濾槽——在搭配原版組件或混合自動化系統時，能精確控制通過的物品種類。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/storage_interface_filtered.png\" alt=\"storage_interface_filtered.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>背包</h1>\n<h3>說明</h3>\n<p>背包是可穿戴的儲物道具，提供多種材質變體，各自擁有不同的儲存容量與升級槽位。背包專為無縫整合自動化系統而設計，具備多個隔層：主倉庫用於存放大量物品、工具隔層用於保管貴重裝備，以及專屬的升級槽位。透過模組化升級（如磁力吸附、物品補充、自動餵食、工具切換，甚至飛行），背包的功能遠超基礎儲物，成為冒險、建造或專注自動化玩法的萬用夥伴。</p>\n<h2>背包</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>工業鐵、安山岩、銅、黃銅與硬化背包</li>\n<li>每個背包最多可安裝六個升級模組，影響穿戴時的運作方式</li>\n<li>不同材質的背包，各槽位可儲存的物品數量有所不同</li>\n<li>儲存空間分為三個隔層：<ul>\n<li><strong>主倉庫：</strong>主要儲存區域，物品可被漏斗、滑槽、導管等設備存取</li>\n<li><strong>工具倉庫：</strong>安全隔層，用於存放工具或珍貴物品（自動化設備無法存取）</li>\n<li><strong>升級槽位：</strong>存放背包升級模組；使用 [Ctrl] + 右鍵 可啟用/停用</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack.png\" alt=\"backpack.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_andesite.png\" alt=\"backpack_andesite.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_brass.png\" alt=\"backpack_brass.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_copper.png\" alt=\"backpack_copper.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_hardened.png\" alt=\"backpack_hardened.png\"></p>\n<h2>背包升級</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物品</th>\n<th>名稱</th>\n<th>說明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_magnet.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_magnet.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>磁鐵升級</strong></td>\n<td>可從最多 5 格遠將物品吸入背包的主儲存格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_itempickup.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_itempickup.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>物品拾取升級</strong></td>\n<td>將物品直接傳送至背包主儲存格，而非玩家背包欄位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_pickblock.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_pickblock.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>快捷選取升級</strong></td>\n<td>可直接從背包中快捷選取物品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_refill.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_refill.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>自動補給升級</strong></td>\n<td>若背包中有備用，則自動為玩家的主手或副手武器/工具進行補給</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_toolswap.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_toolswap.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>工具切換升級</strong></td>\n<td>當挖掘方塊或攻擊實體時，自動將主手工具替換為目前可用的最佳工具或武器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_feeder.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_feeder.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>餵食升級</strong></td>\n<td>當玩家飢餓度足夠時，自動從背包中餵食食物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_flight.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_flight.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>飛行升級</strong></td>\n<td>將任何背包轉變為具有懸停功能的噴射背包（使用 Create 模組的後背燃料槽作為燃料）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_falling.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_falling.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>摔落保護升級</strong></td>\n<td>穿戴此背包時可完全免疫摔落傷害</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_oremining.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_oremining.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>礦脈開採升級</strong></td>\n<td>可一鍵開採整群相同的礦石方塊，並將掉落物集中至玩家附近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_torchdeployer.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_torchdeployer.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>火把放置升級</strong></td>\n<td>當周圍光線不足時，自動從背包中放置火把</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_jukebox.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_jukebox.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>唱機升級</strong></td>\n<td>播放背包音樂碟槽位中的唱片，提供增益效果與氛圍音效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_health.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_health.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>機械之心升級</strong></td>\n<td>為穿戴者提供額外的生命之心（可於設定檔調整數量）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h1>傳輸方塊</h1>\n<h3>說明</h3>\n<p>傳輸方塊是一種用於相鄰容器間傳遞物品的實用方塊。其運作方式類似漏斗，一次移動一個物品，但本身不具備內部儲存空間。智慧傳輸方塊在基礎傳輸方塊上進行了擴展，支援物品過濾功能，且每次可傳遞最多 64 個物品。</p>\n<h2>基礎傳輸方塊</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>直接在容器之間移動物品，包含原版儲存方塊</li>\n<li>沿著朝向方向傳遞物品（可使用 Create 扳手旋轉朝向）</li>\n<li>每次僅移動一個物品，類似漏斗</li>\n<li>無內部儲存空間——物品會瞬間穿過</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/passer_block.png\" alt=\"passer_block.png\"></p>\n<h2>智慧傳輸方塊</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>繼承基礎傳輸方塊的所有功能</li>\n<li>支援使用 Create 過濾器進行物品過濾</li>\n<li>可透過數值面板調整傳遞數量（點擊並按住過濾器欄位即可調整）</li>\n<li>接收紅石訊號時將暫停物品傳遞</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/smart_passer_block.png\" alt=\"smart_passer_block.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/smart_passer_block_powered.png\" alt=\"smart_passer_block_powered.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>相容性</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模組</th>\n<th>支援程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Create</strong></td>\n<td>必要模組 —— 深度整合於整個模組中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Packager / Stock Keeper</strong></td>\n<td>完整整合物流網路功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>JEI / EMI / REI</strong></td>\n<td>支援從背包欄位複製配方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Curios</strong></td>\n<td>支援將背包裝備於背部插槽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Every Compat (Wood Good)</strong></td>\n<td>為簡易儲存箱與裝飾條紋提供模組新增的木頭材質</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Construction Wand/Sticks</strong></td>\n<td>支援放置背包與儲存箱方塊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Create Aeronautics</strong></td>\n<td>完整支援組裝載具上的所有相關組件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>需求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Minecraft：</strong>1.21.1 / 1.20.1</li>\n<li><strong>模組載入器：</strong>NeoForge 21.1.181+ / Forge 47.3.30+</li>\n<li><strong>Create：</strong>6.0.7+</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FoxyNoTail</strong> —— 原始模組概念與 Fabric 版本實作</li>\n<li><strong>ausmez</strong> —— NeoForge/Forge 移植與持續開發</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><em>依據 GNU GPL 3.0 授權條款發布</em></p>",
